WEBVTT

00:09:28.553 --> 00:09:31.883
to shell companies
in the British Virgin Islands.

00:09:31.907 --> 00:09:34.155
So we spoke to sources in country,

00:09:34.179 --> 00:09:37.191
trawled through company
documents and other information

00:09:37.215 --> 00:09:41.246
trying to piece together a really
true picture of the deal.

00:09:41.270 --> 00:09:44.071
And we were alarmed to find
that these shell companies

00:09:44.095 --> 00:09:46.587
had quickly flipped many of the assets on

00:09:46.611 --> 00:09:50.808
for huge profits to major
international mining companies

00:09:50.832 --> 00:09:53.171
listed in London.

00:09:53.195 --> 00:09:56.427
Now, the Africa Progress
Panel, led by Kofi Annan,

00:09:56.451 --> 00:09:59.315
they've calculated
that Congo may have lost

00:09:59.339 --> 00:10:04.419
more than 1.3 billion dollars
from these deals.